  <jpcrp_cor:CriticalContractsForOperationTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h3&gt;５【経営上の重要な契約等】&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; text-align: left"&gt;(1）業務提携契約&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 649px"&gt;
